
    Here is the description of the June 98 milestone,
intermediate goals and list of tasks for each subgroup.
Please look this over and send me your comments before
we officially commit to this.

    I have attempted to show inter-task dependencies. 
As yet there is no mention of infrastructure dependencies 
(edm, framework, etc.).  I have allowed time at the 
end for integration.   Comments from Meena and Serban
incorporated.  Inconsistencies fixed 3/18/98.


				John

------------------------------------------------------- 

TASKS FOR JUNE 1998 RECO MILESTONE

John Womersley 3/18/98


1. SMT

   milestone:  read digitized data from d0gstar
               reconstruct hits and clusters
               use d0 geometry system
               provide clusters to TRF++
               find primary vertex using global tracks from TRF++

   intermediate goals

   1.1	digitized information from d0gstar wrapper 
	who:	Narain
	start:	now
	end:	March 15

   1.2	reconstruct hits in barrels and disks
	who:	Norman
	start:	after 6.1  (geometry interface)
	end:	March 31

   1.3	interface with global tracking environment
	who:	Kulik
	start:  after 1.2, 6.2  (functional geometry) and 5.1 (design)
	end:	May

   1.4	primary vertex
	who:	Narain
	start:	after 5.2  (global tracks available)
	end:	June 15

2. CFT

   milestone:  use d0 geometry system
               
   intermediate goals

